{"seq":26,"slug":"data-mesh-architecture","title":"数据网格架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.36,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据网格架构\">数据网格架构</h1><p>数据网格（Data Mesh）是由 Zhamak Dehghani 在 2019 年提出的分布式数据架构范式，核心思想是将数据所有权下放到业务领域，将数据作为产品管理，通过自服务基础设施和联邦治理实现大规模数据组织能力。它不是一种工具或平台，而是一套组织、技术与文化的综合设计原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么\">本 Hub 讲什么</h2><p>本 Hub 系统讲解数据网格的四大原则及其工程落地：<strong>领域导向所有权</strong>如何从组织结构推导出数据边界；<strong>数据即产品</strong>如何通过 SLO、schema 契约和发现元数据实现数据的可信消费；<strong>自服务数据平台</strong>如何让领域团队独立构建和运营数据产品；<strong>联邦计算治理</strong>如何在自治和合规之间找到平衡。</p>\n<p>目标读者：中级后端/数据工程师，已有分布式系统或数据平台基础，希望理解数据网格架构思想并推动团队落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四个章节\">四个章节</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>覆盖内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1. 原则层</strong></td>\n<td>数据网格四原则、领域建模与 ownership 映射、联邦治理与互操作标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2. 架构层</strong></td>\n<td>数据产品规格、自服务平台设计、发现与目录系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3. 实现层</strong></td>\n<td>数据产品平台工程、可观测性与质量、数据产品 SDK/sidecar 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4. 演进层</strong></td>\n<td>组织变革与 Conway 定律、从集中式迁移路径、成熟度评估模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 Hub 的边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数据平台工程（09_）</strong>：讲集中式 Data Platform 的构建——Lakehouse、Iceberg、摄入管道、存储层；数据网格是对其组织局限的回应，关注所有权而非管道实现。</li>\n<li><strong>数据密集型应用（10_）</strong>：聚焦单个系统的数据处理模式——批处理、流处理、分区、索引；数据网格关注跨多个领域的数据组织架构，不关注单个系统内部。</li>\n<li><strong>事件驱动微服务（23_）</strong>：讲微服务间的事件异步通信、Saga、Outbox；数据网格的输出端口可以是事件流，但核心关注数据产品的所有权与接口契约，而非消息传递模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Zhamak Dehghani《Data Mesh》（O&#39;Reilly, 2022）——范式原著</li>\n<li>DataHub、Amundsen、OpenMetadata——数据目录实践</li>\n<li>Google Dataplex、Azure Purview——云原生数据网格产品</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principles","title":"数据网格原则","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-mesh-four-principles","title":"数据网格四原则与领域导向所有权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles/data-mesh-four-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"domain-modeling-ownership","title":"领域建模与数据 Ownership 映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles/domain-modeling-ownership"},{"seq":3,"slug":"federated-governance-interop","title":"联邦治理与互操作性标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles/federated-governance-interop"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"数据网格架构层","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-product-spec","title":"数据产品规格设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/data-product-spec"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-serve-platform","title":"自服务数据平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/self-serve-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"discovery-catalog","title":"数据发现与目录系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/discovery-catalog"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"数据产品实现层","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-product-platform-sdk","title":"数据产品平台工程：SDK 与 Sidecar 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/implementation/data-product-platform-sdk"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-quality","title":"数据可观测性与质量保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/implementation/observability-quality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"end-to-end-pipeline","title":"召回与排名管道：从 Kafka 流到数据产品的端到端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/implementation/end-to-end-pipeline"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"adoption","title":"数据网格演进与采纳层","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/adoption","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organization-change","title":"组织变革与 Conway 定律对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/adoption/organization-change"},{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-from-centralized","title":"从集中式数据平台迁移到数据网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/adoption/migration-from-centralized"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-model","title":"数据网格成熟度评估模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/adoption/maturity-model"}]}]}